The Policy-Counter-Identifier AVP (AVP code 2901) is of type UTF8String
The Policy-Counter-Status AVP (AVP code 2902) is of type UTF8String
The Policy-Counter-Status-Report AVP (AVP code 2903) is of type Grouped
The SL-Request-Type AVP (AVP code 2904) is of type Enumerated
The Pending-Policy-Counter-Information AVP (AVP code 2905) is of type Grouped
The Pending-Policy-Counter-Change-Time AVP (AVP code 2906) is of type Time
The Experimental-Result-Code AVP (AVP Code 298) is of type Unsigned32
